==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's common print illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Majestic Dawn|Buneary|53}} from the {{TCG|Majestic Dawn}} expansion, and the {{TCGP|Promo-B|promo}} print illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Silver Tempest|Buneary|144}} from the {{TCG|Silver Tempest}} expansion.
*'''{{m|Double Kick}}''' is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Buneary}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Shield}}.

